DTEND:20260914T223000Z
SUMMARY:Deliverage | Ep. 2 - Another Completely Legal Transaction Behind
 the Bins
DESCRIPTION:We're back in the delivery business, and everything remains
 entirely above board. We're simply meeting people behind bins, exchanging
 packages, and going about our perfectly ordinary working day. Please stop
 looking at us like that. Deliverage is a hardcore open-world PvP delivery
 game where every shipment is a gamble. Fight other players for valuable
 cargo, repair and modify fragile vehicles, outplay rivals in a shifting
 economy, and climb from nothing to the top of a ruthless world.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qZU6yfqMjbw
CATEGORIES:Deliverage
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24532211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260825T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T212600Z
DTSTART:20260915T203000Z
DTEND:20260915T223000Z
SUMMARY:Cat Me If You Can | Ep. 1 - I'm Not Leaving Until Every Cat Has
 Had Its Photo Taken
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new series begins, and tonight we have one extremely
 important objective: photograph the cats. All of them. If there's a cat
 somewhere that hasn't had its picture taken, then clearly our work isn't
 finished. Grab the camera and get ready for a cosy hunt for cats! Explore
 beautifully handcrafted black-and-white comic-style 3D worlds, searching
 every corner for hundreds of cleverly hidden feline friends. Photograph
 the cats you discover to bring colour back into the world, while solving
 puzzles, decoding clues and finding secret pathways along the way. With
 locations inspired by Ancient Egypt, modern Japan and medieval castles,
 this looks like the perfect game for slowing down, exploring and seeing
 just how many cats we can find.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j7GcUp_qQio
CATEGORIES:Cat Me If You Can
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24552211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260827T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T212600Z
DTSTART:20260917T203000Z
DTEND:20260917T223000Z
SUMMARY:The Oregon Trail | Ep. 5 - Nothing Brings a Wagon Party Together
 Like a Little Dysentery
DESCRIPTION:The wagon rolls onward, although possibly with slightly fewer
 healthy passengers than we'd like. Expect dangerous terrain, difficult
 choices, dwindling supplies, unexpected disasters, and the traditional
 Oregon Trail approach to healthcare. The Oregon Trail is back in a
 beautiful blend of charming pixel art characters, 3D environments, and
 cutting-edge lighting and visual effects!\n\nThe Oregon Trail by
 Gameloft-Experience The Oregon Trail like never before. A modern twist on
 the trials and tribulations of the road to Oregon, this official successor
 to the global phenomenon will immerse players in exhilarating journeys
 ranging from the historically accurate to the totally extreme. Players
 will pick their traveling party, stock the wagon with supplies, and embark
 on an adventure filled with tough choices, new dangers, and unexpected
 situations. Surviving blizzards, broken limbs, snakebites, exhaustion,
 starvation, and the dreaded dysentery is no small feat; all the while
 navigating an untamed frontier to get your party to their new life in
 Oregon before the winter. Track down a missing party in the aftermath of a
 fierce blizzard, transport volatile gunpowder through blistering desert
 heat, compete in challenging hunting mini-games, and meet a broad cast of
 historic figures. With procedurally selected random events where players'
 choices affect their party and future game events, there's always a new
 adventure on the horizon every time you play.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YDQts9N-Yas
CATEGORIES:The Oregon Trail
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24562211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260828T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T212600Z
DTSTART:20260918T203000Z
DTEND:20260918T223000Z
SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 19 - Sun's Going Down. Best Settle
 This Before Dark.
DESCRIPTION:Arthur rides again as our journey through Red Dead Redemption
 II continues. The sun is disappearing over the horizon, trouble is
 undoubtedly nearby, and if there's unfinished business to deal with, we'd
 probably better handle it before things get even darker. Arthur Morgan and
 the Van der Linde Gang are outlaws on the run. With federal agents and
 bounty hunters massing on their heels, the gang must rob, steal, and fight
 their way across the rugged heartland in order to survive.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2D2TczfFTCk
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24572211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260829T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T212600Z
DTSTART:20260919T203000Z
DTEND:20260919T223000Z
SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 2 - New Life in
 Cyrodiil, What Could Go Wrong?
DESCRIPTION:Our new life in Cyrodiil continues! There are quests to
 complete, dungeons to explore, characters to meet, and an enormous fantasy
 world filled with opportunities to become distracted by absolutely
 everything except whatever we're actually supposed to be doing. Return to
 the province of Cyrodiil in a remastered version of the legendary
 open-world RPG. With the Emperor slain and mysterious Oblivion Gates
 opening across the land, we'll create our character, explore towns and
 ancient ruins, take on quests, join factions, delve into dangerous
 dungeons and battle the forces of Mehrunes Dagon. Whether we follow the
 main story or get completely distracted by side quests, there's a huge
 fantasy world waiting to be rediscovered.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5TckVSwfNlE
CATEGORIES:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
