DTSTAMP:20260831T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T212600Z
DTSTART:20260921T203000Z
DTEND:20260921T223000Z
SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 46 - All This Work for an Overpriced
 Sandwich and a Toilet
DESCRIPTION:After countless hours of heavy machinery, concrete, planning,
 and questionable engineering decisions, our service area project
 continues. All this effort so future travellers can enjoy the privilege of
 paying far too much for a sandwich before discovering there's a queue for
 the toilet. Construction Simulator is back - bigger and better than ever!
 Take charge of over 70 machines, dozens of them brand new to the
 franchise, and build to your heart's content on two huge maps - on your
 own or with your friends!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24602211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260901T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T212600Z
DTSTART:20260922T203000Z
DTEND:20260922T223000Z
SUMMARY:Valheim | Ep. 1 - Ravenheim Server Launch, Odin Is Already Judging
 Us
DESCRIPTION:A brand-new adventure begins as the Ravenheim server
 officially launches! It's time to gather resources, build our first
 settlement, explore the wilderness, fight whatever decides we're lunch,
 and attempt to convince Odin that leaving us unsupervised was definitely a
 good idea. Welcome to Ravenheim, my private Valheim server where I'll be
 joining friends for our own Viking adventure! Together we'll explore the
 vast procedurally generated world, gather resources, build and expand our
 settlements, craft new equipment, sail across dangerous seas and take on
 the creatures and bosses that stand in our way. Expect plenty of
 exploration, building, survival and the inevitable chaos that comes from a
 group of friends attempting to work together. Ravenheim is our world, and
 who knows what stories we'll create along the way!
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Valheim
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
