SUMMARY:The Oregon Trail | Ep. 6 - The Harmonica Played. The Love &
 Dysentery Spread. Gary & Samwise Remain.
DESCRIPTION:Many have travelled the trail. Not everyone has survived it.
 Yet somehow Gary and Samwise remain. The wagon rolls onward as supplies
 dwindle, illnesses spread, the harmonica plays, and our remaining
 travellers desperately attempt to reach the end of this increasingly
 cursed journey. The Oregon Trail is back in a beautiful blend of charming
 pixel art characters, 3D environments, and cutting-edge lighting and
 visual effects!\n\nThe Oregon Trail by Gameloft-Experience The Oregon
 Trail like never before. A modern twist on the trials and tribulations of
 the road to Oregon, this official successor to the global phenomenon will
 immerse players in exhilarating journeys ranging from the historically
 accurate to the totally extreme. Players will pick their traveling party,
 stock the wagon with supplies, and embark on an adventure filled with
 tough choices, new dangers, and unexpected situations. Surviving
 blizzards, broken limbs, snakebites, exhaustion, starvation, and the
 dreaded dysentery is no small feat; all the while navigating an untamed
 frontier to get your party to their new life in Oregon before the winter.
 Track down a missing party in the aftermath of a fierce blizzard,
 transport volatile gunpowder through blistering desert heat, compete in
 challenging hunting mini-games, and meet a broad cast of historic figures.
 With procedurally selected random events where players' choices affect
 their party and future game events, there's always a new adventure on the
 horizon every time you play.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:The Oregon Trail
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
