SUMMARY:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon | Ep. 2 - Cheshire,
 We Are NOT Keeping Whatever That Is
DESCRIPTION:Back into the mysterious forest with Cereza and Cheshire for
 another beautiful evening of magical exploration, puzzles, strange
 creatures, and the ongoing struggle to stop Cheshire from treating every
 new discovery like something we should bring home. A magical storybook
 adventure following a young Cereza, long before she became the legendary
 Bayonetta. Alongside her demon companion Cheshire, she explores an
 enchanted forest filled with puzzles, secrets, and dangerous creatures in
 a beautifully illustrated fantasy world.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
