SUMMARY:The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion Remastered | Ep. 3 - Lovely Place,
 Shame About the Gates to Hell
DESCRIPTION:Cyrodiil really is beautiful. Rolling countryside, historic
 cities, picturesque forests... and enormous fiery portals leading directly
 into a demonic realm. Property prices must be complicated. Our Oblivion
 Remastered adventure continues! Return to the province of Cyrodiil in a
 remastered version of the legendary open-world RPG. With the Emperor slain
 and mysterious Oblivion Gates opening across the land, we'll create our
 character, explore towns and ancient ruins, take on quests, join factions,
 delve into dangerous dungeons and battle the forces of Mehrunes Dagon.
 Whether we follow the main story or get completely distracted by side
 quests, there's a huge fantasy world waiting to be rediscovered.
